#: src/janus.md:1
msgid "Janus"
msgstr ""

#: src/janus.md:3
msgid ""
"[Janus](https://github.com/casey/janus) is a tool for checking whether a "
"change to `just` breaks or changes the interpretation of existing "
"`justfile`s. It collects and analyzes public `justfile`s on GitHub."
msgstr ""

#: src/janus.md:7
msgid ""
"Before merging a particularly large or gruesome change, Janus should be run "
"to make sure that nothing breaks. Don’t worry about running Janus yourself, "
"Casey will happily run it for you on changes that need it."
msgstr ""
